            "question_text": {
                "english": "A force F = -K(y î + x ĵ) (where k is a positive constant) acts on a particle moving in the xy plane. Starting from the origin, the particle is taken along the positive x axis to the point (a, 0) and then parallel to the y axis to the point (a, a). The total work done by the force F on the particle is -",
